  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and carrot.\n• Trim green beans and slice into thirds.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/636d1a44aeef818d310bc0c1/step-370e1248.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot or saucepan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until tender, 5-6 mins.\n• Add garlic seasoning and garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/636d1a44aeef818d310bc0c1/step-38416318.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add green beans, diced tomatoes, lentils (including water from the tin), vegetable stock powder, the water and brown sugar.\n• Stir to combine, then bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 10 mins.\n• Stir through butter and spinach until wilted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/636d1a44aeef818d310bc0c1/step-1093312a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian lentil veggie soup between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan cheese to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/636d1a44aeef818d310bc0c1/step-6bacbe85.jpg"
    }
  ]
